---
# Microsoft is the closest predefined style to the surrounding WinUI and
# C++/WinRT ecosystem. The explicit values below are repository invariants and
# remain stable even if a future clang-format changes a style default.
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft
UseTab: Never
IndentWidth: 4
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 120

# C++/WinRT requires generated headers to precede declarations that consume
# them. Formatting must never silently reorder that semantically significant
# include sequence.
SortIncludes:
  Enabled: false
...
